    "heading": "Hit Point Dice",
    "lineStart": 13303,
    "lineEnd": 13305
  },
  "section": "8.83",
  "rulesText": "Hit Point Dice, or Hit Dice for short, help determine a player character's Hit Point maximum, as explained in “Character Creation.” Most monsters also have Hit Dice. A creature can spend Hit Dice during a Short Rest to regain Hit Points. See also “Short Rest.”"
}
